PPT Master skill

Install:
  Install the missing PPT Master skill, system tools and Python environment; prepare installer dependencies and repair incomplete Python dependencies.

Upgrade:
  Back up and replace the installed PPT Master skill; update installed system tools and rebuild its Python environment, restoring previous skill files and environment if setup fails.

Status:
  Report skill locations based on SKILL.md presence, system package versions, and core Python import availability.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Source: https://github.com/hugohe3/ppt-master
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/ppt-master
  Existing copies at ${CODEX_HOME:-$HOME/.codex}/skills/ppt-master are consolidated into links to the destination when skill files are replaced.
  Python 3.12 environment: .venv inside the installed skill directory.
  The installed SKILL.md documents the configured Python environment and runtime usage.
  LibreOffice uses the same APT package as the libreoffice application module.
  External image-generation services require user-provided credentials.
